{"root":"punggung","ipa":"/puŋ.ɡuŋ/","core":"指人或动物身体的背部，也常用于比喻事物的背面或后部。","pos":["名词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/puŋ.ɡuŋ/","zh":"背部，脊背","phrases":[{"t":"sakit punggung","zh":"背痛"},{"t":"punggung tangan","zh":"手背"},{"t":"menyandarkan punggung","zh":"靠背"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia menggendong anaknya di punggung.","zh":"他把孩子背在背上。"},{"t":"Punggungnya terasa pegal setelah bekerja seharian.","zh":"工作了一整天后，他的背部感到酸痛。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"punggung","ipa":"/puŋ.ɡuŋ/","zh":"背部","phrase":{"t":"punggung gunung","zh":"山脊"},"example":{"t":"Dia duduk di punggung kursi.","zh":"他坐在椅背上。"}},{"w":"berpunggung","ipa":"/bər.puŋ.ɡuŋ/","zh":"有背的，背对背的","phrase":{"t":"duduk berpunggung","zh":"背靠背坐着"},"example":{"t":"Mereka duduk berpunggung tanpa berbicara.","zh":"他们背靠背坐着，一言不发。"}},{"w":"memunggungkan","ipa":"/mə.muŋ.ɡuŋ.kan/","zh":"背向，使背部朝向","phrase":{"t":"memunggungkan badan","zh":"转过身去"},"example":{"t":"Dia memunggungkan badannya saat marah.","zh":"生气时他转过身去背对着人。"}}],"derSlugs":["punggung","berpunggung","memunggungkan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-26T16:24:28.746Z","src":"base"}